@startuml LMS_Transaction_DFD
title Transaction DFD: Transaction Center Dispatch

skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "Librarian / Patron" as User #E3F2FD

rectangle "0.0 Login & Session Dispatcher\n(Authenticate & Validate Role)" as P0 #EEEEEE

rectangle "1.0 TRANSACTION CENTER\nIdentify Request Type\n[Issue | Return | Renew | Reserve | Catalog | Report]" as TC #FFF9C4

package "Action Branches" {
  rectangle "2.0 Process Issue" as P_Issue #E8F5E9
  rectangle "3.0 Process Return" as P_Return #E8F5E9
  rectangle "4.0 Process Renew" as P_Renew #E8F5E9
  rectangle "5.0 Process Reservation" as P_Reserve #E8F5E9
  rectangle "6.0 Process Cataloging" as P_Catalog #E8F5E9
  rectangle "7.0 Generate Reports" as P_Report #E8F5E9
}

database "Library Data Stores\n(Titles, Copies, Patrons, Loans, Fines, Holds)" as DB #FCE4EC

User --> P0 : Credentials + Request
P0 --> TC : Authenticated Transaction

TC --> P_Issue : [ISSUE]
TC --> P_Return : [RETURN]
TC --> P_Renew : [RENEW]
TC --> P_Reserve : [RESERVE]
TC --> P_Catalog : [CATALOG]
TC --> P_Report : [REPORT]

P_Issue <--> DB
P_Return <--> DB
P_Renew <--> DB
P_Reserve <--> DB
P_Catalog <--> DB
P_Report <--> DB

note bottom of TC
  **Transaction Analysis:**
  Single data stream enters the center,
  dispatched to independent action branches.
end note

@enduml
